1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:04,454
Only one of these three college recommendations is actually unsupported. Can you spot it?

2
00:00:04,754 --> 00:00:09,316
A — apply to a research program, after confirming you meet its published requirements.

3
00:00:09,596 --> 00:00:13,883
B — explore volunteering in your intended major, and check the requirements first.

4
00:00:14,163 --> 00:00:18,024
C — you're eligible for this research program, because you're interested in the subject.

5
00:00:18,424 --> 00:00:20,980
Which one's unsupported? Take a guess before the reveal.

6
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:22,333
It's C.

7
00:00:22,713 --> 00:00:26,133
Being interested in a subject doesn't automatically mean you qualify.

8
00:00:26,383 --> 00:00:29,601
An AI recommendation shouldn't present an assumption as a fact.

9
00:00:29,981 --> 00:00:32,678
That's why the reasoning behind a recommendation matters.

10
00:00:32,878 --> 00:00:33,586
Meet AppGap.
